wb-docker-app (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging tails for day-2 lifecycle & observability (issue #5):
    - apt.conf.d drop-in excluding wb-docker-app and wb-* service packages
      from unattended-upgrades (upgrades stay explicit);
    - wb-diag-collect drop-in + collector script capturing each service's
      systemctl status and recent journal logs into the diagnostic archive;
    - documented downgrade/rollback (apt downgrade) and the pre-major-upgrade
      data-backup warning (design.md §3.11.1).

 -- Wiren Board Team <info@wirenboard.com>  Mon, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

